<title>MOLDOVA: Moldova 28-, 91-day T-bill yields fall.</title>
<headline>Moldova 28-, 91-day T-bill yields fall.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The annualised yield on Moldovan 28-day Treasury bills fell to 25.25 percent on Tuesday from 26.60 percent at the previous auction on December 17, a National Bank official told Reuters.</p>
<p>The yield on 91-day T-bills fell to 26.06 percent from 27.88 percent last Tuesday.</p>
<p>The 182-day T-bills yielded 29.70 percent, unchanged from the previous auction on November 26.</p>
<p>Full details of the 28-day T-bill auction:</p>
